        <p class="font-ui text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-charcoal/40 mb-4">Segmented turning</p>
        <p class="font-body text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Design segmented bowls ring by ring. Set outside diameter, height, wall width, and segment count for each ring. Visualize the turned profile with draggable Bézier handles. Paint wood species onto individual segments or apply pattern presets. Add feature rings with mosaic inlay. Preview joint alignment in 3D before you cut a single piece.
        </p>
